# creed-gateway-partner — HTTPS on 8095. Run with the `local` environment
# (http-client.private.env.json sets verifyHostCertificate=false) to skip the self-signed cert check.

### aggregate catalog + order (load-balanced, audited)
GET https://localhost:8095/api/partner/aggregate
Accept: application/json

### load-balanced passthrough to catalog
GET https://localhost:8095/api/partner/catalog
Accept: application/json

### load-balanced passthrough to order
GET https://localhost:8095/api/partner/order
Accept: application/json

### actuator: list metrics
GET https://localhost:8095/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json

### actuator: aggregate pool — max connections
GET https://localhost:8095/actuator/metrics/httpcomponents.httpclient.pool.total.max?tag=httpclient:creed-partner-aggregate
Accept: application/json

### actuator: aggregate pool — total connections (state=available|leased)
GET https://localhost:8095/actuator/metrics/httpcomponents.httpclient.pool.total.connections?tag=httpclient:creed-partner-aggregate
Accept: application/json

### actuator: aggregate pool — pending (requests waiting for a connection)
GET https://localhost:8095/actuator/metrics/httpcomponents.httpclient.pool.total.pending?tag=httpclient:creed-partner-aggregate
Accept: application/json

### actuator: health-check pool — max connections
GET https://localhost:8095/actuator/metrics/httpcomponents.httpclient.pool.total.max?tag=httpclient:creed-partner-health
Accept: application/json
